            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Tiki Bar At Tuan Chau Island",
            "review_text": "Анжелика К\n5 contributions\n0\nPleasant place for a beach holiday\nAug 2024 • Couples\nClear place🙂\nThe menu is familiar. Wings, burgers, bread with garlic (baguette with garlic butter). On garlic bread immediately presented croutons from Borodinsky, but alas)))\nThe bar has delicious cocktails, local cold beer.\nA very cozy place with good music. \nNear the cafe there are umbrellas and sun loungers, you can order food and while it is prepared to swim in the sea. \nView from the cafe to the bay. It's super beautiful.\nBeautiful interior. \nThe fun part is there's no dump of food waste, rags, dirty kitchenware near the cafe, with the characteristic smell of rotten fish. The bar owner clearly knows what service is available in other countries.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten August 3, 2024\nSergio\nThank you for taking the time to share your thoughts! We're delighted you enjoyed our cozy atmosphere, music, cocktails, and cold local beer. It’s great to hear that our view of the bay and our comfortable beach setup added to your experience.\n\nWe appreciate your feedback on the garlic bread; we'll keep that in mind for future menu updates. Cleanliness and maintaining a pleasant environment are top priorities for us, and we’re glad you noticed! Thank you again for visiting, and we hope to welcome you back for more relaxing moments by the sea.\n\nWarm regards,\nSergio\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
