            "review_text": "Sem N\n1 contribution\n0\nVery good bar!\nJul 2024 • Family\nGreat spot, excellent food, fair prices and great hospiltality. What do you want more? Number #1 bar/restaurant here at the beach.\nWritten July 27, 2024\nSergio\nThank you for your wonderful review! We're delighted to hear you enjoyed our food, prices, and hospitality. It's an honor to be considered the top spot on the beach. We can't wait to serve you again soon!\nWritten July 31, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
