            "review_title": "Review at Tiki Bar At Tuan Chau Island",
            "review_text": "Stray Cat\nHạ Long Bay, Vietnam44 contributions\n0\nBest Thai food in Ha Long (& the drinks/western food are fab as well) - 'On the beach\"!\nJun 2024 • Couples\nYes, very nice indeed. Good menu with an excellent new chef who can make both Western & Thai dishes. Had a few of the dishes and also the cocktails to check the place out. Yep, very, very good for this area. Well worth a visit and will come here again very soon - it's on our radar! Only heard good things about this place and its owner (Sergio - top man). The 'proof is in the pudding' as the saying goes in England. Top notch (and you can swim as it's right on the beach)!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 24, 2024\nSergio\nDear Sean,\n\nThank you for your fantastic review! We're delighted to hear you enjoyed the diverse menu and cocktails at TIKI Bar. It's wonderful to know our new chef's skills in both Western and Thai dishes impressed you. Me, the owner and the entire team truly appreciate your kind words. We look forward to welcoming you back soon for another memorable experience on the beach. \n\nBest regards, \nSergio\n\n---\nRead more\nWritten June 27, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
