            "review_text": "Graham J\nEngland, United Kingdom10 contributions\n0\nBeach bars in Tuan Chau.\nMay 2024 • Couples\nThe Tiki Bar is ideally situated on the beach with a breathtaking view of the islands. We usually have the chicken wings washed down with a couple of beers. Great place to unwind.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 19, 2024\nSergio\nThank you for your kind words! We're delighted that you enjoy our beachfront location and the stunning island views. It's great to hear that our TIKI Chicken wings and beers helps you to unwind. We look forward to welcoming you back for more relaxing moments.\nWritten June 15, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
