            "review_title": "Review at Tiki Bar At Tuan Chau Island",
            "review_text": "Xavier_rosset\nVerbier, Switzerland33 contributions\n0\nGo for a nice drink on the beach\nNov 2023 • Solo\nVery nice beach bar.\nNice cocktails and some beach food.\nTh place is very clean, even the beach in the front of the bar is daily cleaned.\nWritten November 8, 2023\nSergio\nThank you, Xavier Rosset, for your wonderful review of TIKI Bar!\n\nWe're delighted to hear that you had a great experience at our beach bar. It's our pleasure to serve you delicious cocktails and beach-inspired food. We take great pride in maintaining a clean and inviting environment for our guests, including the pristine beach right in front of the bar.\nYour positive feedback means a lot to us, and we look forward to welcoming you back to TIKI Bar for more beachside enjoyment. Cheers to many more memorable moments by the sea! 🏖️🍹\nRead more\nWritten November 12, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
